---
import { RiArrowRightLine } from "@remixicon/react";
---

<section id="Inicio" class="relative w-full scroll-mt-[72px] overflow-hidden pt-[136px] pb-16 lg:pb-24">
  <div class="dot-grid-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[520px]"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1240px] flex-col items-center px-5 text-center lg:px-8">
    <a
      href="#IA"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-stroke-soft-200 bg-white-0 py-1 pl-1 pr-4 shadow-regular-xs transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-stroke-sub-300"
    >
      <span class="rounded-full bg-feature-lighter px-2.5 py-1 text-label-xs text-feature-dark">Nuevo</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-label-sm text-sub-600">
        Descubre la IA de AmunPOS
        <RiArrowRightLine className="size-3.5" />
      </span>
    </a>

    <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-title-h3 text-strong-950 sm:text-title-h2 lg:text-title-h1">
      El punto de venta que hace el trabajo pesado por ti
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-paragraph-lg text-sub-600">
      AmunPOS une ventas, inventario, facturación y nómina en un solo panel — y le suma
      inteligencia artificial que migra tus datos, lee tus facturas y arma los horarios de
      tu equipo. Menos operación manual, más tiempo para hacer crecer tu negocio.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="#IA"
        class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-10 bg-white-0 px-5 text-label-md text-strong-950 shadow-regular-xs ring-1 ring-inset ring-stroke-soft-200 transition duration-200 hover:bg-weak-50"
      >
        Ver demo
      </a>
      <a
        href="#Planes"
        class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-10 bg-primary-base px-5 text-label-md text-static-white transition duration-200 hover:bg-primary-darker focus-visible:shadow-button-primary-focus focus-visible:outline-none"
      >
        Regístrate gratis
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mt-16 w-full max-w-[1080px]">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-x-8 -bottom-10 h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-white-0 via-white-0/60 to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-stroke-soft-200 bg-white-0 shadow-regular-md">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-stroke-soft-200 bg-weak-50 px-4 py-3">
          <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-stroke-sub-300"></span>
          <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-stroke-sub-300"></span>
          <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-stroke-sub-300"></span>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/capture-of-pos.png"
          alt="Vista del panel de AmunPOS"
          width="1679"
          height="918"
          class="h-auto w-full object-cover object-top"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
